meta {
  name: Complete Order
  type: http
  seq: 11
}

post {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/v1/master/orders/{{order_id}}/complete
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
  X-Locale: {{locale}}
}

docs {
  # Complete Order

  Changes order status: `in_progress` → `completed`. No request body — the
  endpoint does not accept a price; `final_price` in the response is whatever
  the administrator set in the panel (`null` otherwise).

  After this the client can leave a review (`04_orders` → Leave Review).

  **Response 200:** `MasterOrderResource`
  ```json
  {
    "data": {
      "id": 1,
      "status": "completed",
      "client_name": "Merdan",
      "client_phone": "+99361234567",
      "address": "Ashgabat, Korogly 12",
      "latitude": 37.95,
      "longitude": 58.38,
      "category": "Сантехника",
      "description": "Сломался кран на кухне",
      "final_price": null,
      "assigned_at": "2026-05-16T10:05:00+05:00",
      "started_at": "2026-05-16T11:00:00+05:00",
      "completed_at": "2026-05-16T12:30:00+05:00",
      "created_at": "2026-05-16T10:00:00+05:00"
    }
  }
  ```

  **Errors:**
  - `422` — order not in `in_progress` status
  - `404` — order not assigned to this master
}
